Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(motion): support parallel lanes, islands, and corner
 cleanup in adaptive trochoidal (#1587)

Support wide rectangular pockets, branching L/triangle pockets, islands, closed rings round islands, and concentric wall/corner clean-up peels in 2D Adaptive (Trochoidal).

Fixes #1587
